  "content": "[Intro]\n[C#m]\n[B]\n[G#m]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[B]\n[G#m]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[B]\n[G#m]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[B]\n[G#m]\n[A]\n\n[Verse]\n[C#m]It doesn't make a-\n[E6/B]ny sense\n[G#m/D#]This tragic en-\n[A/E]ding\n[C#m]In spite of the e-\n[E6/B]vidence There's\n[G#m/D#]something still mis-\n[A/E]sing\n[C#m]Heard some of the ru-\n[E6/B]mors told\n[G#m/D#]A taste of one's\n[A/E]wealth\n[C#m]Did Victoria wound\n[E6/B]his soul? Did\n[G#m/D#]she bid him fare-\n[A/E]well? One last time\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]\n[B]We'll lay down\n[G#m]today\n[A]One last\n[C#m]time\n[B]Until we fade\n[G#m]away\n[A]One last\n[C#m]time\n[B]We'll lay down\n[G#m]today\n[A]One last\n[C#m]time\n[B]We slowly fade\n[G#m]away\n[A]\n\n[Bridge]\n[F#11]\n\n[Solo]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Asus2]Here I am inside his\n[Bsus4]home\n[Asus2]It holds the many clues To\n[F#11]my suspicions\n[Asus2]And as I'm standing here right\n[Bsus4]now I'm\n[Csus2]finally shown what I\n[D]have always known\n[Asus2]Coincidence I can't belive\n[Bsus4]As my\n[F#m]childhood dreams [E]slowly come\n[D]true\n[E]\n\n[Outro]\n[G]Are these her\nmemories\n[A]A-\nwakened through my eyes\n[Bm]\nThis house has\n[G#m7b5]brought back to\nlife\n[F]\n[G/F]An open door\n[Ab]I walk on through\n[Bb/Ab]Into his bedroom\n[Cm]Feeling as\n[Eb/Bb]cold as outside The\n[Fm]walls disappear To some\n[Ab/Eb]woman who's screaming A\n[Dm7b5]man pleads forgiveness His\n[Db]words I cannot\n[Cm]hear",
